  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.2,
      "text": "human phrasing. Take a simple three-word phrase, dog bites man. If the computer receives"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.2,
      "end": 11.88,
      "text": "those three tokens all at once without knowing the sequence, they could easily be arranged"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.88,
      "end": 17.94,
      "text": "as man bites dog. The raw tokens are identical, but without sequence, the meaning is destroyed."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.62,
      "end": 23.76,
      "text": "To solve this, the architecture includes an extra step. It stamps the vector with a signal"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.76,
      "end": 29.76,
      "text": "saying, I am token number one, or I am token number two. The technical name for this critical"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.76,
      "end": 35.46,
      "text": "structural patch is positional encoding. The AI gets the full computational benefit of simultaneous"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.46,
      "end": 41.64,
      "text": "processing while preserving the linear narrative of human speech. Attention is all you need."
    }
  ],
